p} · ${x.phone}'),trailing:x.isPrimary?const Chip(label:Text('Primary')):null))),const SizedBox(height:14),Card(child:Padding(padding:const EdgeInsets.all(16),child:Column(crossAxisAlignment:CrossAxisAlignment.start,children:[const Text('Trip safety controls',style:TextStyle(fontWeight:FontWeight.w900,fontSize:16)),const SizedBox(height:10),_row(Icons.pin_rounded,'Boarding PIN','Driver verifies the 4-digit customer PIN before starting the trip.'),_row(Icons.location_searching_rounded,'GPS health','Customer and Admin see delayed/stale location indicators.'),_row(Icons.route_rounded,'Route monitoring','Deviation and long-stop events are stored for safety review.'),_row(Icons.badge_outlined,'Driver compliance','Expired licence, CNIC, registration and insurance can restrict new rides.')])))]));
 Widget _row(IconData i,String t,String s)=>Padding(padding:const EdgeInsets.only(bottom:12),child:Row(crossAxisAlignment:CrossAxisAlignment.start,children:[Icon(i,color:AppColors.primaryDark),const SizedBox(width:10),Expanded(child:Column(crossAxisAlignment:CrossAxisAlignment.start,children:[Text(t,style:const TextStyle(fontWeight:FontWeight.w800)),Text(s,style:const TextStyle(color:AppColors.muted,fontSize:12,height:1.35))]))]));
 Future<void> addContact()async{final n=TextEditingController(),p=TextEditingController(),r=TextEditingController();bool primary=contacts.isEmpty;final ok=await showDialog<bool>(context:context,builder:(c)=>StatefulBuilder(builder:(c,set)=>AlertDialog(title:const Text('Add trusted contact'),content:Column(mainAxisSize:MainAxisSize.min,children:[TextField(controller:n,decoration:const InputDecoration(labelText:'Name')),TextField(controller:p,keyboardType:TextInputType.phone,decoration:const InputDecoration(labelText:'Phone number')),TextField(controller:r,decoration:const InputDecoration(labelText:'Relationship')),CheckboxListTile(contentPadding:EdgeInsets.zero,value:primary,onChanged:(v)=>set(()=>primary=v??false),title:const Text('Primary emergency contact'))]),actions:[TextButton(onPressed:()=>Navigator.pop(c,false),child:const Text('Cancel')),FilledButton(onPressed:()=>Navigator.pop(c,true),child:const Text('Save'))])));if(ok==true&&n.text.trim().isNotEmpty&&p.text.trim().isNotEmpty){await repo.addContact(name:n.text.trim(),phone:p.text.trim(),relationship:r.text.trim().isEmpty?'Family':r.text.trim(),primary:primary);await load();}}
}
